The '''Enigma Fruit''' is a [[Fruit Treasures|Fruit Treasure]] found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. It improves the effect of most [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

Despite making [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] easier to defeat, the Enigma Fruit is not considered as one of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] nor [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], which have an entirely different effect.

==Effect==
At 100% on all Enigma Fruit Treasures, the following [[Special Abilities|abilities]] are enhanced when used against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien Enemies]]:
