==Trivia==
*Despite being listed eighth in the [[Treasure]] menu, the Enigma Fruit is actually the sixth obtainable Cats of the Cosmos Treasure.
*The Enigma Fruit originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*The Enigma Fruit, like other fruits is based on a real-life fruit, this being a cantaloupe.
